WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:03.250
<b>You need to get lost!</b>

00:03.750 --> 00:05.170
<b>You should get lost!</b>

00:05.330 --> 00:06.880
<b>Get lost already!</b>

00:07.460 --> 00:09.040
<b>I will defeat you.</b>

00:09.710 --> 00:11.790
<b>You can't stop me from reaching Ms. Syr!</b>

00:12.500 --> 00:14.880
<b>You've been blessed with the love of a Goddess,</b>

00:15.080 --> 00:17.330
<b>yet you choose to reject it and oppose her?</b>

00:18.960 --> 00:20.080
<b>Fine, then.</b>

00:21.080 --> 00:22.080
<b>Bring it.</b>

00:23.380 --> 00:25.500
<b>This is going to be the end!</b>

00:30.500 --> 00:31.830
<b>Uchide no Kozuchi!</b>

00:32.080 --> 00:33.380
<b>Dance and whirl!</b>

00:40.630 --> 00:42.130
<b>Bell!</b>

00:43.750 --> 00:45.750
<b>Goddess! And Ms. Haruhime!</b>

00:45.750 --> 00:46.960
<b>Why are you here?</b>

00:47.250 --> 00:49.290
<b>I came to update your status!</b>

00:49.790 --> 00:52.040
<b>I'll use your excelia to give you a power boost!</b>

00:53.000 --> 00:55.540
<b>You're going to take down the King, aren't you?</b>

00:55.830 --> 00:58.420
<b>And then you're going to save Syr, right?</b>

01:02.380 --> 01:03.750
<b>Go get it done, Bell.</b>

01:04.080 --> 01:06.080
<b>We'll rough him up while you're gone.</b>

01:06.290 --> 01:08.670
<b>Make it snappy, rabbit.</b>

01:08.830 --> 01:09.460
<b>Right!</b>

01:24.000 --> 01:26.580
<b>Hope you like being blindsided, dumbass!</b>

01:50.290 --> 01:51.080
<b>Unreal...</b>

01:51.080 --> 01:52.750
<b>Oh, don't be silly.</b>

01:53.080 --> 01:55.290
<b>You're about to go join the action yourself!</b>

01:56.170 --> 01:59.500
<b>The total increase on his basic abilities goes over 999.</b>

01:59.830 --> 02:01.250
<b>Yet it's still not enough.</b>

02:01.580 --> 02:05.290
<b>He can't compete with that apex of power
even with the boost that he'll get from this.</b>

02:05.790 --> 02:06.580
<b>But even so!</b>

02:07.790 --> 02:11.710
<b>Listen to me, Bell. You're about to be
on equal footing with those adventurers.</b>

02:12.670 --> 02:15.420
<b>And you'll surpass them. I know you have it in you.</b>

02:16.380 --> 02:17.540
<b>So, hang tough.</b>

02:18.130 --> 02:19.130
<b>And win this!</b>

02:19.830 --> 02:21.420
<b>I will, Goddess!</b>

02:21.790 --> 02:22.750
<b>Master Bell.</b>

02:24.750 --> 02:26.420
<b>May fortune smile upon you.</b>

02:41.420 --> 02:42.380
<b>Let's do this!</b>

02:42.580 --> 02:44.580
<b>Gooooo!</b>

03:23.830 --> 03:28.040
<b>Right now, they effectively have
one level 6 and three level 7s.</b>

03:28.330 --> 03:31.790
<b>That's a party strong enough
to conquer the Deep Floors. And yet...</b>

03:32.250 --> 03:34.380
<b>It's still not enough to defeat him, eh?</b>

03:35.080 --> 03:37.000
<b>That boar-faced jackass.</b>

03:37.330 --> 03:39.710
<b>He's already reached level friggin' 8.</b>

03:40.830 --> 03:41.960
<b>This sucks!</b>

03:41.960 --> 03:44.040
<b>How the hell is anyone supposed to beat him?!</b>

03:44.040 --> 03:44.920
<b>Don't ask me!</b>

03:45.290 --> 03:49.920
<b>Hedin's almost tapped out, even though he has
the greatest reserve of magic power in all Orario.</b>

03:50.210 --> 03:51.630
<b>It's dangerous to let this drag on.</b>

03:52.540 --> 03:53.830
<b>They still have a chance.</b>

03:54.080 --> 03:57.040
<b>Ottarl's beast form isn't an invincible skill by any means.</b>

03:58.000 --> 04:00.040
<b>I'm sure Hedin knows that.</b>

04:00.580 --> 04:03.040
<b>All they can do is keep laying on the pressure!</b>

04:06.210 --> 04:08.750
<b>Holy cow!</b>

04:09.040 --> 04:11.790
<b>Nothing can bring him down!</b>

04:13.290 --> 04:18.380
<b>This is what peak performance looks like!
This is the power of Ottarl the King!</b>

04:19.380 --> 04:24.000
<b>Is it time for the allied army to kiss all hope goodbye?!</b>

04:32.130 --> 04:33.330
<b>Nothing is working!</b>

04:34.670 --> 04:36.460
<b>I can't get him to go down!</b>

04:46.000 --> 04:48.130
<b>But I won't stop until I reach Ms. Syr!</b>

04:52.290 --> 04:54.040
<b>Because I promised...</b>

04:55.460 --> 04:57.830
<b>that I would save her!</b>

05:03.920 --> 05:05.290
<b>Godsdammit!</b>

05:05.750 --> 05:09.170
<b>I hate this! He's even gotten his hooks into me!</b>

05:11.000 --> 05:13.580
<b>Fine. I'll admit it.</b>

05:13.920 --> 05:16.920
<b>That moron would never make the choice to be her Ord.</b>

05:16.920 --> 05:20.130
<b>Which is exactly why he's the one
who can make her realize...</b>

05:20.670 --> 05:22.670
<b>that's not what love is.</b>

05:22.960 --> 05:23.960
<b>Watch out, Hedin!</b>

05:26.040 --> 05:28.830
<b>"Strike evermore, immortal lightning general."</b>

05:29.210 --> 05:30.670
<b>Valiant Hildr!</b>

05:42.790 --> 05:44.880
<b>MASTER!</b>

05:51.170 --> 05:51.960
<b>Master!</b>

05:54.880 --> 05:57.290
<b>Keep... your focus...</b>

05:58.670 --> 06:01.750
<b>You must... save her...</b>

06:02.420 --> 06:07.080
<b>"Perform evermore, immortal saintess."</b>

06:08.000 --> 06:10.130
<b>Laurus Hildr.</b>

06:15.000 --> 06:17.420
<b>Go, my dumb apprentice.</b>

06:43.540 --> 06:45.750
<b>All I can see is a blur of light...</b>

06:45.750 --> 06:47.670
<b>That's Hedin's third spell!</b>

06:47.960 --> 06:49.250
<b>A lightning enchantment?!</b>

06:49.500 --> 06:51.750
<b>It's boosting both his recovery and his agility!</b>

06:53.630 --> 06:54.500
<b>Oh my...</b>

06:55.130 --> 06:58.670
<b>It's like the legend of the
"Thunderbolt Knight" come to life.</b>

07:01.380 --> 07:04.380
<b>With Master's help, there is no limit to where I can go!</b>

07:04.380 --> 07:06.130
<b>To who I can defeat!</b>

07:06.290 --> 07:08.380
<b>And right now, I have to defeat HIM!</b>

07:32.670 --> 07:33.670
<b>I remember.</b>

07:34.330 --> 07:36.500
<b>I've felt this sensation before...</b>

07:37.500 --> 07:38.710
<b>The desire to win!</b>

07:40.290 --> 07:42.380
<b>The need to overcome the wall before me!</b>

07:43.420 --> 07:48.080
<b>But I'm not fighting alone... everyone is supporting me!</b>

07:53.250 --> 07:55.040
<b>I'm sorry for being weak.</b>

07:55.540 --> 07:58.170
<b>I'm sorry that I can't go toe-to-toe with you by myself.</b>

07:59.000 --> 08:02.000
<b>We're going to beat you together! So just go down!</b>

08:02.670 --> 08:04.500
<b>You're punching too far above your weight!</b>

08:06.040 --> 08:08.170
<b>Stand aside, kid!</b>

08:16.630 --> 08:18.170
<b>Ms. Mia! Ms. Ryu!</b>

08:18.460 --> 08:19.290
<b>I'm going all in!</b>

08:29.420 --> 08:30.380
<b>Wait, his right arm...</b>

08:34.460 --> 08:35.830
<b>He's already seen it coming!</b>

08:41.250 --> 08:44.540
<b>You're better off embracing that habit and
using it as way to lure your opponent in.</b>

08:45.380 --> 08:46.830
<b>That sonuva bitch!</b>

08:47.080 --> 08:49.130
<b>Smooth move, kid!</b>

08:54.750 --> 08:58.000
<b>Have some more!</b>

08:58.210 --> 09:01.080
<b>"Let the light of stardust occupy me
and strike my enemy!"</b>

09:01.080 --> 09:02.790
<b>Luminous Wind!</b>

09:11.130 --> 09:14.250
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

09:52.130 --> 09:54.880
<b>Th-they've done it!</b>

09:55.130 --> 09:58.040
<b>The King is DOWN!</b>

10:02.130 --> 10:05.420
<b>Hell yeah! They finally beat him!</b>

10:07.540 --> 10:11.130
<b>It's not over yet.
He's Orario's most powerful adventurer.</b>

10:11.330 --> 10:13.130
<b>Even after taking all that damage...</b>

10:13.540 --> 10:15.330
<b>he can still fight!</b>

10:16.670 --> 10:20.330
<b>Do you have... what it takes to set her free?</b>

10:21.210 --> 10:21.880
<b>Huh?</b>

10:23.880 --> 10:25.540
<b>Can you save her?</b>

10:27.130 --> 10:28.000
<b>Yes!</b>

10:31.210 --> 10:32.880
<b>Then let's see you do it.</b>

10:33.710 --> 10:36.630
<b>Bell. Vana Freya is heading this way.</b>

10:39.460 --> 10:41.250
<b>We're going to lose if he catches up.</b>

10:41.580 --> 10:43.500
<b>You have to make a break for Freya right now!</b>

10:43.710 --> 10:47.130
<b>It's all on you, kid. We're just dead weight right now.</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:51.210
<b>We'll keep Lady Hestia safe. You just focus on Syr!</b>

10:55.130 --> 10:56.040
<b>Not far now.</b>

10:56.790 --> 10:58.130
<b>Ms. Syr is right there.</b>

11:01.080 --> 11:03.750
<b>There is no winner yet, folks!</b>

11:03.750 --> 11:06.250
<b>The battle is over, but the War Game goes on!</b>

11:06.540 --> 11:09.330
<b>The final showdown will be a game of tag!</b>

11:09.580 --> 11:12.040
<b>Crazy to think this is gonna come down to a foot race.</b>

11:12.040 --> 11:17.500
<b>Yeah. If Bell can run fast enough to reach Freya and
snatch her flower, then the allied army will win.</b>

11:17.880 --> 11:20.630
<b>But on the other hand, if Vana Freya takes Bell out...</b>

11:21.420 --> 11:24.500
<b>then it's only a matter of time before Hestia
and the others lose their flowers.</b>

11:24.920 --> 11:28.000
<b>Now what? You gonna start
praying to Zeus or something?</b>

11:28.250 --> 11:29.960
<b>Oh please, that's a waste of time.</b>

11:30.250 --> 11:32.540
<b>Zeus would just sit there and laugh his ass off.</b>

11:32.880 --> 11:35.960
<b>Ugh! Either Astrea or Athena will do!</b>

11:35.960 --> 11:37.960
<b>Somebody just please let Bell escape!</b>

11:38.170 --> 11:41.170
<b>Well, somebody's got a big thing
for the prim and proper type!</b>

11:43.000 --> 11:44.920
<b>Sucks for you, Mr. Goody Two-Shoes.</b>

11:45.710 --> 11:48.170
<b>Looks like nobody's answering your prayers.</b>

11:51.500 --> 11:52.540
<b>There you are!</b>

11:53.130 --> 11:56.080
<b>Uh-oh! Vana Freya is coming in hot!</b>

11:56.080 --> 11:57.750
<b>No! Stay away!</b>

11:58.040 --> 12:00.830
<b>Get the lead out, Rabbit's Foot!</b>

12:00.830 --> 12:01.880
<b>He's losing ground!</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:03.920
<b>It's still a long way to the temple.</b>

12:04.540 --> 12:06.880
<b>Don't look back! Swing your arms, dammit!</b>

12:07.080 --> 12:09.630
<b>Show us a miracle, Rabbit's Foot!</b>

12:10.380 --> 12:11.290
<b>Go!</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:13.880
<b>Run for it, Bell!</b>

12:18.000 --> 12:20.420
<b>Just keep running, Bell! Don't stop!</b>

12:22.080 --> 12:25.330
<b>You're the only one we have left now!</b>

12:28.130 --> 12:31.130
<b>Hello? Is anybody out there?</b>

12:31.880 --> 12:35.250
<b>Please... somebody help Master Bell!</b>

12:38.080 --> 12:41.880
<b>I'm begging you! Master Bell needs help!</b>

12:42.380 --> 12:43.880
<b>Somebody go to him!</b>

12:44.790 --> 12:46.790
<b>Head to the west side!</b>

12:47.000 --> 12:49.130
<b>And help Master Bell!</b>

13:00.080 --> 13:02.580
<b>This is gonna be a real nail-biter of an ending, folks!</b>

13:02.580 --> 13:05.460
<b>Nobody asked for it, but we're getting it anyway!</b>

13:05.460 --> 13:07.330
<b>Aw crap, here he comes!</b>

13:07.420 --> 13:08.750
<b>This is the end of the line!</b>

13:16.250 --> 13:17.670
<b>I'm not giving up here!</b>

13:21.290 --> 13:22.880
<b>Master entrusted everything to me!</b>

13:24.210 --> 13:27.920
<b>So did Ms. Ryu and Ms. Mia! Even Mr. Ottarl!</b>

13:28.380 --> 13:30.500
<b>I have a promise to keep!</b>

13:31.040 --> 13:32.000
<b>I'll save you!</b>

13:32.330 --> 13:34.330
<b>Just hang on tight, Ms. Syr!</b>

13:35.210 --> 13:38.750
<b>They're on the home stretch!</b>

13:41.710 --> 13:43.210
<b>Say your prayers!</b>

13:49.960 --> 13:51.000
<b>Bell!</b>

13:52.670 --> 13:53.830
<b>I don't believe it!</b>

13:53.830 --> 13:54.790
<b>Go!</b>

13:55.290 --> 13:58.420
<b>Whoa! He's gone turbo!</b>

14:01.880 --> 14:03.920
<b>YOU LITTLE SHIT!</b>

14:04.040 --> 14:06.460
<b>Rusk! Lemilia! Stop him!</b>

14:10.790 --> 14:13.000
<b>"Golden wheel and silver collar."</b>

14:13.210 --> 14:15.750
<b>"Amidst scorning love and dead fantasies,"</b>

14:16.000 --> 14:17.710
<b>"here the Fates arrive."</b>

14:18.830 --> 14:19.960
<b>"Wildly I charge..."</b>

14:20.500 --> 14:23.080
<b>"delivering Her divine will!"</b>

14:24.170 --> 14:26.380
<b>Gralineze...</b>

14:27.920 --> 14:30.170
<b>"Burn bright! Forbidden spell!"</b>

14:39.920 --> 14:41.630
<b>I heard you, Lil' Squeak.</b>

14:41.920 --> 14:43.540
<b>And I made it just in time.</b>

14:44.880 --> 14:47.540
<b>Losers deserve to eat dirt, right?</b>

14:47.880 --> 14:50.580
<b>You friggin' worm!</b>

14:51.420 --> 14:53.920
<b>KAZUKI!</b>

14:56.710 --> 14:59.130
<b>The blacksmith comes in clutch!</b>

14:59.290 --> 15:02.210
<b>What an upset!</b>

15:13.080 --> 15:14.210
<b>Ms. Syr.</b>

15:19.290 --> 15:21.380
<b>Bell. Stop right there.</b>

15:25.710 --> 15:26.710
<b>Why...?</b>

15:29.880 --> 15:32.290
<b>Why won't you just be mine?!</b>

15:32.790 --> 15:36.420
<b>How can you reject my love?!
I'm Freya, for crying out loud!</b>

15:38.250 --> 15:41.920
<b>I couldn't win you over as Syr, so I chose to be Freya.</b>

15:42.290 --> 15:43.750
<b>But if that won't work either...</b>

15:44.040 --> 15:46.080
<b>what else can I even do?!</b>

15:46.460 --> 15:48.420
<b>I'm supposed to be the Goddess of Love!</b>

15:48.420 --> 15:53.210
<b>Yet, deep down, my heart keeps telling me
that you're the one person who I don't want to love!</b>

15:53.750 --> 15:55.380
<b>I'm crazy about you, Bell.</b>

15:56.420 --> 16:00.040
<b>You're the love of my life.
I want to spend forever with you.</b>

16:00.920 --> 16:02.710
<b>And I really want you to choose me.</b>

16:03.630 --> 16:06.830
<b>My heart aches. I yearn for you to hold me.</b>

16:07.500 --> 16:10.130
<b>I'm so sick of agonizing over what tomorrow has in store!</b>

16:11.420 --> 16:13.710
<b>I never even wanted to experience this.</b>

16:14.250 --> 16:18.210
<b>But all the same, I want to know
where these feelings take me...</b>

16:18.540 --> 16:20.330
<b>I can't help but be curious!</b>

16:21.630 --> 16:24.330
<b>I love you, Bell.</b>

16:31.880 --> 16:32.710
<b>I...</b>

16:33.710 --> 16:35.580
<b>can never be yours.</b>

16:37.130 --> 16:40.130
<b>I'm not the one who can be your Ord.</b>

16:40.710 --> 16:41.750
<b>All I can do...</b>

16:44.420 --> 16:47.830
<b>is bring some closure to your crush on me!</b>

17:03.000 --> 17:04.630
<b>I wanted to know for sure.</b>

17:05.170 --> 17:09.750
<b>Was what I was feeling love? Or was it infatuation?</b>

17:10.500 --> 17:15.330
<b>As the Goddess of Love, what I always yearned
for was the sweet taste of having a pure crush.</b>

17:16.330 --> 17:17.580
<b>I adored it.</b>

17:18.290 --> 17:19.500
<b>Dreamed of it.</b>

17:20.380 --> 17:22.880
<b>Love is unconditional. Love is absolute.</b>

17:23.460 --> 17:26.540
<b>And my love was desired by all without rhyme or reason.</b>

17:27.170 --> 17:30.580
<b>But over time, I grew tired of living like that.</b>

17:32.460 --> 17:34.080
<b>There was only one exception.</b>

17:34.670 --> 17:37.540
<b>One person in the entire world who I was infatuated with.</b>

17:38.130 --> 17:40.580
<b>Because he never did what I wanted him to.</b>

17:41.130 --> 17:42.460
<b>Oh, the irony.</b>

17:43.290 --> 17:44.210
<b>Is that really all?</b>

17:46.670 --> 17:48.170
<b>Remember what he said?</b>

17:48.670 --> 17:53.040
<b>If he won the War Game,
he wanted to meet with the "real you".</b>

17:54.330 --> 17:55.920
<b>The real me?</b>

17:58.920 --> 18:01.790
<b>Just don't leave any room for regrets, okay?</b>

18:12.420 --> 18:14.130
<b>How did it come to this?</b>

18:14.380 --> 18:17.290
<b>Because you pissed off too many people, obviously.</b>

18:17.670 --> 18:21.040
<b>Although, the mental gymnastics that
Hedin pulled certainly didn't help, either.</b>

18:22.250 --> 18:25.500
<b>Bloody hell. You're broker than a bum now, aren'tcha?</b>

18:25.750 --> 18:28.630
<b>Don't come to say goodbye just to get a free drink.</b>

18:28.880 --> 18:30.170
<b>What else can I do?</b>

18:30.580 --> 18:35.000
<b>I had my Familia disbanded.
And all my assets were taken away.</b>

18:35.630 --> 18:39.040
<b>Just count yourself lucky
you didn't get sent back to Heaven.</b>

18:39.460 --> 18:45.210
<b>I hear the guild bigwigs are at a complete loss over how
to handle Ottarl and the others moving forward, though.</b>

18:47.000 --> 18:50.960
<b>"Be the heroes this world needs."
That was my final order to them.</b>

18:59.130 --> 19:02.750
<b>Since you're broke, you'll just have to work
for a living like you did before.</b>

19:03.500 --> 19:09.040
<b>I've heard talk that a certain pint-sized Goddess
is willing to overlook one tavern girl staying in town.</b>

19:09.790 --> 19:10.960
<b>I would never.</b>

19:10.960 --> 19:12.830
<b>That's just too pitiful.</b>

19:20.210 --> 19:23.380
<b>Farewell, Mia. It's been fun.</b>

19:27.670 --> 19:28.670
<b>Ms. Syr.</b>

19:29.710 --> 19:31.040
<b>Are you really leaving?</b>

19:31.880 --> 19:33.380
<b>That's how this usually works.</b>

19:34.670 --> 19:37.130
<b>Or are you planning to lead me on again?</b>

19:38.290 --> 19:40.080
<b>Even after you raised such a big stink,</b>

19:40.080 --> 19:43.130
<b>and repeatedly rejected me for your own peace of mind?</b>

19:45.130 --> 19:46.210
<b>It's all right.</b>

19:47.330 --> 19:51.500
<b>I'm grateful you put a firm end
to my crush. It truly did save me.</b>

19:52.670 --> 19:54.710
<b>I finally learned to let go.</b>

19:56.290 --> 19:57.880
<b>Thank you, Bell.</b>

19:58.380 --> 20:00.380
<b>I'll always be thinking of you.</b>

20:01.000 --> 20:04.750
<b>Always. Right up until I get sick and tired of it.</b>

20:14.130 --> 20:16.670
<b>Don't you have anything to say to the rest of us?</b>

20:22.790 --> 20:24.080
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

20:29.290 --> 20:31.290
<b>If you feel guilty, then own up to it!</b>

20:31.710 --> 20:33.750
<b>You're the one who saved my life!</b>

20:34.170 --> 20:36.460
<b>You can't run from the responsibility that comes with it!</b>

20:36.710 --> 20:39.790
<b>I'm going to make you eat humble pie!
And suffer all the consequences!</b>

20:40.290 --> 20:41.670
<b>Don't leave.</b>

20:42.380 --> 20:45.130
<b>Stay here with us forever, dammit!</b>

20:46.040 --> 20:47.420
<b>You won't get away scot-furry!</b>

20:47.830 --> 20:52.960
<b>Don't try to argue you're uncomfurtable because of divine
pride or pity or whatever. We don't give a puss!</b>

20:53.170 --> 20:57.630
<b>That's right! Cuz we're not even
talking to a Goddess right now.</b>

20:57.630 --> 20:59.210
<b>Just our coworker.</b>

21:03.420 --> 21:04.500
<b>Lady Freya...</b>

21:07.210 --> 21:08.290
<b>Syr!</b>

21:09.750 --> 21:10.920
<b>Anya...</b>

21:12.080 --> 21:15.880
<b>I'm too dumb to figure anything meowt right now.</b>

21:15.880 --> 21:19.000
<b>But I would really hate fur Syr to leave!</b>

21:21.880 --> 21:24.750
<b>I want you to stay!</b>

21:30.380 --> 21:32.250
<b>Here, this is for you.</b>

21:40.580 --> 21:43.540
<b>I already know that I can't be your Ord.</b>

21:44.540 --> 21:46.540
<b>I can't be Sir Fulland, either.</b>

21:46.540 --> 21:49.170
<b>This secret sinks</b>

21:47.460 --> 21:48.420
<b>But...</b>

21:49.170 --> 21:51.630
<b>Into the undulating water's surface</b>

21:49.710 --> 21:51.540
<b>I think I can be your protector.</b>

21:52.040 --> 21:56.250
<b>There was apparently enough room to notice</b>

21:52.080 --> 21:54.960
<b>A knight who will endure hardship alongside you.</b>

21:56.920 --> 21:58.000
<b>Mr. Bell.</b>

21:57.040 --> 22:03.670
<b>Though unable to express them clearly, my pure-white feelings</b>

21:58.710 --> 22:01.540
<b>Yeah, so... um...</b>

22:03.670 --> 22:06.880
<b>Once again become desires when called out</b>

22:06.880 --> 22:11.880
<b>These eager emotions surge just like waves</b>

22:12.250 --> 22:17.460
<b>Swelling up unknowingly with a gentle tingle</b>

22:15.790 --> 22:18.000
<b>N-naughty little minx.</b>

22:18.330 --> 22:23.330
<b>I'm gonna take charge of you so that you can't
get into any more trouble. Brace yourself.</b>

22:18.540 --> 22:25.080
<b>And after the wall dividing us crumbled, the words I understood</b>

22:25.210 --> 22:29.540
<b>Simply float unsteadily in the sky</b>

22:27.040 --> 22:28.170
<b>Mr. Bell!</b>

22:30.040 --> 22:35.630
<b>I want a love that grows bountiful even if it's empty</b>

22:32.040 --> 22:35.170
<b>I want to quit being a Goddess!</b>

22:35.880 --> 22:41.210
<b>If this is a dream I might as well take the lies out, too</b>

22:36.790 --> 22:37.710
<b>I...</b>

22:38.330 --> 22:40.130
<b>want to stay here forever!</b>

22:40.920 --> 22:43.830
<b>With all of you! And just be Syr!</b>

22:41.210 --> 22:44.830
<b>Even a life that cannot be stolen</b>

22:44.960 --> 22:50.420
<b>Changes the heart by filling it a little</b>

22:48.540 --> 22:50.250
<b>Syr!</b>

22:50.710 --> 22:56.380
<b>An innocent mist that's like a dizzy spell</b>

22:52.080 --> 22:53.000
<b>Syr!</b>

22:53.000 --> 22:55.040
<b>No more hard felines!</b>

22:58.330 --> 23:00.080
<b>Happy now, you louse?</b>

23:00.380 --> 23:02.420
<b>I don't know if this is as good as it gets.</b>

23:02.750 --> 23:03.630
<b>But...</b>

23:05.330 --> 23:06.580
<b>it's not bad.</b>

23:08.250 --> 23:11.170
<b>You made the grade, my dumb apprentice.</b>

23:19.460 --> 23:22.790
<b>Truly, a most loathsome man.</b>

23:30.000 --> 23:31.420
<b>You saved Syr.</b>

23:31.920 --> 23:33.630
<b>You saved both of us.</b>

23:34.460 --> 23:35.920
<b>So thank you...</b>

23:37.130 --> 23:41.000
<b>Syr</b>

23:37.130 --> 23:41.000
<b>"First Love"</b>

23:37.380 --> 23:38.500
<b>Bell.</b>
